# Video projects: commit the sources (brief, storyboard, script, compositions, chart data, helper
# scripts), not the media. Clips, audio, posters, fonts and renders are large or not ours to
# redistribute (posters are TMDB images); they regenerate from the scripts here and in src/.
*/assets/clips/
*/assets/voice/
*/assets/bgm/
*/assets/sfx/
*/assets/posters/
*/assets/fonts/
*/assets/*.jpg
*/assets/*.svg
*/capture/
*/renders/
*/snapshots/
*/storyboard-stills/
*/voice-samples/
*/music-preview/
*/*.mp3
*/.media/
*/node_modules/
*/.hyperframes/*.wav
*/.hyperframes/check.json
*/.hyperframes/frame-packets/

# Chart data and marker tracks are small and needed to rebuild the frames (the root .gitignore excludes data/ dirs).
!*/assets/data/
